const customerQuestions=[{"id": 1, "slug": "what-is-quickmind", "category": "Product", "question": "What is QuickMind Home?", "answer": "QuickMind Home is a proposed VR cognitive training offer for home users and caregivers. It combines rented equipment with an annual training subscription. Exact hardware, activities and support are defined in your written quotation.", "detail": "Home training is a different configuration from professional assessment. Start by sharing your country and intended setting so the team can identify the appropriate product."}, {"id": 2, "slug": "who-is-it-for", "category": "Product", "question": "Who is the home system suitable for?", "answer": "Suitability depends on the exact product model, intended use and user needs. Age limits, precautions and any professional supervision must be confirmed before an offer is accepted.", "detail": "Tell the team whether you are enquiring for yourself, a family member or a clinical service. Discuss clinical suitability with a qualified professional rather than using this website to make a diagnosis."}, {"id": 3, "slug": "home-vs-clinic", "category": "Choosing a plan", "question": "How does the Home Plan differ from a clinic configuration?", "answer": "The proposed Home Plan is for one named trainee and home cognitive training. Clinic configurations can include assessment and/or training modules, with hardware and user capacity specified separately.", "detail": "Assessment is not included in the proposed Home Plan. A clinic quotation must identify the selected module, local availability, software licensing and onboarding."}, {"id": 4, "slug": "training-activities", "category": "Product", "question": "What training activities are available?", "answer": "The current materials describe cognitive domains including attention, memory, calculation, abstraction and executive function. The specific activity library depends on the quoted product and software configuration.", "detail": "Ask for a demonstration of the exact version you intend to use. Images on the website illustrate the system and do not guarantee that every depicted activity is included."}, {"id": 5, "slug": "progress-reports", "category": "Product", "question": "Can users and caregivers see progress reports?", "answer": "Available reporting may show training completion and supported performance measures. Caregiver access and the exact report format must be confirmed for your configuration.", "detail": "Training measures are not a diagnosis. The assessment report imagery shown elsewhere on this site should not be assumed to be an included Home Plan feature."}, {"id": 6, "slug": "what-is-included", "category": "Setup", "question": "What equipment and accessories are included?", "answer": "The proposed offer includes one rented QuickMind headset. Exact model, controllers, charger, companion device and accessories will be itemized in your written offer.", "detail": "A laptop or tablet shown in a photograph is not automatically included. Request a packing list and setup requirements before payment."}, {"id": 7, "slug": "setup-requirements", "category": "Setup", "question": "What do I need to set up the system?", "answer": "Internet access, safe space, companion-device requirements and supported account configuration depend on the hardware and software supplied. These requirements should be confirmed before ordering.", "detail": "Ask for the installation guide for the actual model. If assistance is needed, confirm the caregiver role and whether remote onboarding is included."}, {"id": 8, "slug": "languages", "category": "Setup", "question": "Which languages does QuickMind support?", "answer": "Language availability is confirmed for the exact product version. An English website and a country selector do not guarantee that the training software is available in every local language.", "detail": "Include your required language in the enquiry. Ask whether instructions, activities, reporting and customer support are all provided in that language."}, {"id": 9, "slug": "training-schedule", "category": "Setup", "question": "How long and how often should I train?", "answer": "This website does not set a universal training prescription. Session duration and frequency should follow the instructions for the supplied product and any agreed professional guidance.", "detail": "Request the appropriate onboarding and routine for your configuration. Avoid assuming that a demonstration session represents the recommended daily schedule."}, {"id": 10, "slug": "evidence", "category": "Evidence", "question": "What research supports the product?", "answer": "The evidence page summarizes four supplied papers on VR cognitive assessment and related screening methods, with study populations and limitations. These are not proof of the treatment efficacy of the proposed Home Plan.", "detail": "Review the exact article and product scope. For a clinical purchase, ask which studies apply to the specific module, population and intended use in your quotation."}, {"id": 11, "slug": "registrations", "category": "Evidence", "question": "Is QuickMind approved or registered in my country?", "answer": "Registration, listing, notification and conformity records refer to named products and jurisdictions. Their presence does not establish worldwide delivery eligibility or apply automatically to every commercial configuration.", "detail": "The documents page distinguishes the supplied records. Ask the team to confirm the current local status of your exact model before purchase. FDA registration or listing is not described as FDA approval."}, {"id": 12, "slug": "overseas-scenes", "category": "Evidence", "question": "Where has the system been demonstrated or used overseas?", "answer": "The site includes company-supplied photographs of demonstrations in Singapore and Indonesia and community sessions in Hong Kong. These document the settings shown, rather than clinical outcomes.", "detail": "Use the international scenes page to see the experience in context. Ask for a demonstration of the version and workflow suitable for your own organization."}, {"id": 13, "slug": "first-year-price", "category": "Pricing", "question": "How much does the first year cost?", "answer": "The proposed US offer is $499 for the initial equipment rental plus $1,999 for one year of subscription: $2,498 before taxes and shipping. This remains a proposed price pending a confirmed quotation.", "detail": "Your written offer should state currency, delivery, taxes, any duties, product configuration and the payment schedule. The final amount displayed on PayPal must match the agreed offer."}, {"id": 14, "slug": "rental-ownership", "category": "Pricing", "question": "Do I own the headset after paying the rental charge?", "answer": "No. Under the proposed rental model, the equipment remains the supplier\u2019s property. The $499 charge is not represented as a refundable deposit.", "detail": "Rental duration, return conditions, damage treatment and any refund allocation must be agreed in the contract before payment."}, {"id": 15, "slug": "renewal", "category": "Pricing", "question": "How does the annual subscription renew?", "answer": "The proposed renewal is $1,999 per year without another initial equipment charge during uninterrupted rental. Billing dates, cancellation notice and renewal arrangements must be confirmed in writing.", "detail": "The current PayPal hosted button does not establish automatic annual renewal or an integrated subscription-management service on this website."}, {"id": 16, "slug": "paypal-payment", "category": "Ordering", "question": "How can I pay with PayPal or a bank card?", "answer": "The payment area loads the supplied official PayPal Hosted Buttons component. PayPal determines which payment methods are available for the buyer and transaction.", "detail": "Confirm your quotation first, then review the item, currency, amount and recipient on PayPal. Card, Venmo or Pay Later options are not guaranteed. Website orders are not updated automatically after payment."}, {"id": 17, "slug": "international-delivery", "category": "Ordering", "question": "Can you ship to my country?", "answer": "The team accepts enquiries for the US, Europe, Japan, South Korea, Southeast Asia, the Middle East and other destinations. Product eligibility, stock and shipping must be confirmed for your specific country.", "detail": "Specify the actual delivery country and required language. A quote should state dispatch origin, carrier, estimated timing, duties and who is responsible for import arrangements."}, {"id": 18, "slug": "returns-cancellation", "category": "Ordering", "question": "What happens if I cancel or return the equipment?", "answer": "The rental and refund policy is not finalized on this preview. No full refund, free return shipping or cancellation entitlement is promised beyond the terms ultimately agreed for your transaction.", "detail": "Ask for separate rules for an initial return, ending the subscription, returning rented equipment, return postage, damage charges and any subscription refund before paying."}, {"id": 19, "slug": "support-warranty", "category": "Support", "question": "What setup support and warranty are provided?", "answer": "Setup instructions and remote onboarding are proposed. Warranty duration, service coverage, support language and response times depend on the confirmed offer.", "detail": "Contact YIWEI USA INC at yiweiinc99@gmail.com. Include your configuration or quotation reference. Do not include medical records in the website enquiry form."}, {"id": 20, "slug": "clinic-distributor", "category": "Choosing a plan", "question": "Can clinics or distributors request a demonstration and commercial offer?", "answer": "Yes. Use the same enquiry form and select Clinic / care organization or Distributor / commercial partner. Include your country, organization, device quantity and required workflow.", "detail": "Assessment modules, licensing, demo devices, training, territory and commercial terms are discussed individually. An enquiry does not grant exclusive distribution rights or establish a partnership."}];
let faqCategory='All';
function questionLink(q){return '/pages/answers/'+q.slug+'/'}
function answerCta(label='Ask the QuickMind team'){return `<div class="answer-cta"><div><h3>Need an answer for your configuration?</h3><p>One team, one enquiry form. Share your country and requirements.</p><a href="mailto:yiweiinc99@gmail.com">yiweiinc99@gmail.com</a></div><button class="btn" data-action="inquiry">${label}</button></div>`}
function faqPage(){return `<section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">20 CUSTOMER QUESTIONS</span><h1>QuickMind questions,<br>answered clearly.</h1><p>Compare plans, understand the product and check what to confirm before ordering.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn outline" href="/pages/compare/" data-route>Compare Home & Clinic Plans</a><button class="btn" data-action="inquiry">Request a Quote</button></div></section><section class="container section"><div class="filter-bar" aria-label="Filter frequently asked questions">${['All',...new Set(customerQuestions.map(q=>q.category))].map(cat=>`<button class="filter ${faqCategory===cat?'selected':''}" data-faq-category="${cat}" aria-pressed="${faqCategory===cat}">${cat}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="faq customer-faq">${customerQuestions.filter(q=>faqCategory==='All'||q.category===faqCategory).map(q=>`<details><summary>${q.id}. ${q.question}</summary><p>${q.answer}</p><a class="text-link" href="${questionLink(q)}" data-route>Read the full answer →</a></details>`).join('')}</div>${answerCta()}</section>`}
function comparePage(){return `<section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR SETTING</span><h1>Home, clinic<br>or distribution?</h1><p>Compare the purchase pathways before requesting a quotation. Final terms depend on your model and market.</p></section><section class="container section"><div class="comparison"><table><caption class="compare-caption">QuickMind configurations and commercial pathways</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">What to compare</th><th scope="col">Home Plan</th><th scope="col">Clinic / care organization</th><th scope="col">Distributor</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['Purpose','Home cognitive training','Assessment and/or training workflow','Local commercial introduction'],['Users','One named trainee, proposed','Capacity specified in quote','Depends on supplied configurations'],['Assessment','Not included in proposed plan','Selected modules, subject to local availability','Specified per product'],['Hardware','One rented headset, proposed','Configured in quote','Demo and supply terms negotiated'],['First-year price','Proposed $2,498 before tax & shipping','Custom quotation','Commercial quotation'],['Billing','Proposed rental + annual subscription','Agreed commercial terms','Agreed commercial terms'],['Onboarding','Coverage to confirm','Coverage to confirm','Training and support to agree'],['Market eligibility','Country and model to confirm','Country and module to confirm','Local product requirements to confirm']].map(row=>`<tr>${row.map((v,i)=>i?`<td>${v}</td>`:`<th scope="row">${v}</th>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="compare-actions"><button class="btn" data-action="inquiry">Ask About the Home Plan</button><button class="btn outline" data-action="clinic">Request a Clinic Demo</button><button class="btn outline" data-action="distributor">Discuss Distribution</button></div><h2>Questions that help you choose</h2><div class="cards">${customerQuestions.filter(q=>['home-vs-clinic','first-year-price','clinic-distributor'].includes(q.slug)).map(q=>`<article class="feature-card"><h3>${q.question}</h3><p>${q.answer}</p><a class="text-link" href="${questionLink(q)}" data-route>Read the full answer →</a></article>`).join('')}</div>${answerCta()}</section>`}
function answerResource(q){const destinations={Evidence:q.slug==='registrations'?['/pages/registrations/','View product documents']:q.slug==='overseas-scenes'?['/pages/international-scenes/','See international scenes']:['/pages/clinical-evidence/','Review the research'],Pricing:['/pricing/','Review pricing and rental terms'],Ordering:q.slug==='paypal-payment'?['/pricing/','View quotation and payment options']:['/pages/contact/','Confirm delivery and ordering'],Support:['/pages/contact/','Contact setup and support'],Setup:['/home-product/','Explore equipment and setup'],Product:['/home-product/','Explore product features'],'Choosing a plan':['/pages/compare/','Compare configurations']};const [path,label]=destinations[q.category];return `<a class="text-link" href="${path}" data-route>${label} →</a>`}
function answerPage(){const slug=location.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean).at(-1);const q=customerQuestions.find(q=>q.slug===slug);if(!q)return `<section class="container section"><h1>Answer not found</h1><a href="/pages/faq/" data-route>View all customer questions</a></section>`;const related=customerQuestions.filter(x=>x.id!==q.id&&x.category===q.category).slice(0,3);return `<article class="container section answer-article"><span class="eyebrow">${q.category} · QUESTION ${q.id} OF 20</span><h1>${q.question}</h1><p class="lead">${q.answer}</p><h2>What to check before ordering</h2><p>${q.detail}</p>${answerResource(q)}<div class="buttons"><a class="btn outline" href="/pages/compare/" data-route>Compare Plans</a><a class="text-link" href="/pages/faq/" data-route>All 20 Questions</a></div>${answerCta('Ask About This Question')}<h2>Related questions</h2><ul class="related-questions">${related.map(x=>`<li><a href="${questionLink(x)}" data-route>${x.question}</a></li>`).join('')}</ul></article>`}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-faq-category]');if(b){faqCategory=b.dataset.faqCategory;render(false)}});
const retentionReview=[
['/','Home','Medium to high','Photos and distinct home/clinic pathways invite exploration; multiple competing actions may dilute the first choice.','Explore product details or compare plans'],
['/pages/compare/','Compare plans','High','Directly resolves the home-versus-clinic decision and places the next action beside the comparison.','Choose the appropriate quote pathway'],
['/home-product/','Home product','High','Equipment photos, training previews and setup details help a buyer explore the actual configuration.','Request a country-specific quote'],
['/pages/faq/','Customer FAQ','High','Twenty questions let customers locate their concern and continue to a focused answer.','Open an answer or request a quote'],
['/pages/international-scenes/','International scenes','Medium to high','Real demonstrations and gallery filters encourage visual exploration.','Request a demonstration'],
['/pages/answers/first-year-price/','Pricing answer','High for price-focused visitors','Explains the initial total and what must be included in a delivered quotation.','Request a written offer'],
['/pages/clinical-evidence/','Clinical research','Medium to high for professional buyers','Study summaries and original papers support detailed professional review.','Ask about the exact product module'],
['/pricing/','Pricing','Medium','The total is visible, but unresolved rental and renewal details may leave questions.','Read renewal and rental answers'],
['/pages/registrations/','Registration documents','Medium for professional buyers','Market-specific documents are useful but dense for a home buyer.','Confirm local model eligibility'],
['/pages/answers/renewal/','Renewal answer','High for returning buyers','Clarifies the recurring cost and directs the visitor to written rental terms.','Confirm renewal terms'],
['/pages/contact/','Contact','Conversion-focused','A short form is intended to complete an enquiry rather than maximize time on the page.','Prepare an email request']
];
function insightsPage(){const data=localInsights();return `<section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">PAGE REVIEW</span><h1>What may keep<br>customers engaged?</h1><p>AI content assessment and device-local observations are separate. No cross-visitor analytics service is connected.</p></section><section class="container section"><h2>AI assessment of current content</h2><p>These qualitative predictions consider how clearly a page answers a buyer’s question, its visual material, related links and next action. They are hypotheses, not measured retention rates.</p><div class="comparison"><table><thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>Likely exploration</th><th>Reason</th><th>Next step</th></tr></thead><tbody>${retentionReview.map(([path,label,level,reason,next])=>`<tr><td><a href="${path}" data-route>${label}</a></td><td>${level}</td><td>${reason}</td><td>${next}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><h2>Observations on this browser only</h2><p>Anonymous counts stay in this browser’s local storage. No form content, email addresses or query strings are stored in this measurement. Counts are not the site’s total traffic. An email draft is not a sent enquiry; clicking PayPal is not a paid order. Sessions on another device or after clearing storage are not included; privacy preferences may disable collection.</p><div class="comparison"><table><thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>Views</th><th>Visible time (seconds)</th><th>Enquiry clicks</th><th>Internal-link clicks</th><th>Question opens</th><th>Max scroll (%)</th><th>Email drafts</th></tr></thead><tbody>${Object.entries(data).filter(([path])=>siteSeo.pages[path]||siteSeo.pages[path.replace(/^\/(zh-CN|es|fr|de|ja|ko|id)(?=\/)/,'')]).map(([path,row])=>`<tr><td>${path}</td><td>${Number(row.views)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.activeSeconds)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.inquiryClicks)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.internalClicks)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.faqOpens)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.maxScroll)||0}</td><td>${Number(row.emailDrafts)||0}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="8">No observations available on this browser yet.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><p class="fine">Time is recorded when a page is hidden or left, with a maximum of 300 seconds per uninterrupted visible interval. These counts cannot establish conversion rate or global bounce rate.</p><div class="buttons"><button class="btn outline" data-export-engagement>Export Local Counts</button><button class="text-link" data-clear-engagement>Clear Local Counts</button></div><h2>Priority improvements</h2><ol><li>Use the comparison page as the main decision aid for visitors choosing a setting.</li><li>Link each answer to relevant product, evidence or pricing details and one quotation pathway.</li><li>Keep the contact form short; judge it by completed enquiries rather than time spent.</li><li>Measure onward clicks and enquiry completion alongside visible time before changing the main layout.</li></ol><h2>How to validate the hypotheses</h2><p>After public launch, connect a shared analytics backend and compare page views, engaged time, progression to related pages, enquiries and paid orders. Keep enquiry completion separate from a quote-button click. A successful page can convert quickly, so longer time alone does not mean better performance.</p></section>`}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('[data-clear-engagement]')){try{localStorage.removeItem(engagementKey);activePage='';activeStarted=0}catch{}render(false)}if(e.target.closest('[data-export-engagement]')){const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({scope:'This browser only; not global traffic',counts:localInsights()},null,2)],{type:'application/json'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='QuickMind-local-engagement.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}});
